{
  "sourceCommit": "55df565f8d5a49ddc15210ed8c91a697539e0cde",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">MageOS_BlogSeo</h1><a id=\"user-content-mageos_blogseo\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MageOS_BlogSeo\" href=\"#mageos_blogseo\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Connects <a href=\"https://github.com/mage-os-lab/module-blog\">MageOS_Blog</a> to\n<a href=\"https://github.com/mage-os-lab/module-seo\">MageOS_Seo</a>, so a blog post page is described once, by\nMageOS_Seo, in the same structured data as the rest of the store.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What it does</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-it-does\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What it does\" href=\"#what-it-does\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With both modules installed and no bridge, a post page carries two descriptions of who publishes\nit: MageOS_Blog's BlogPosting names the store inline as an Organization, and MageOS_Seo writes its\nown Organization for every page. This module makes it one:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>MageOS_Seo writes the post's BlogPosting.</strong> <code>Model\\ArticleDataProvider</code> gives it the post as\narticle data. The BlogPosting's author and publisher reference MageOS_Seo's Organization by\n<code>@id</code>, and it carries Speakable when MageOS_Seo's Speakable setting is on.</li>\n<li><strong>Configure the Organization</strong> (Marketing → SEO → Organization) for the BlogPosting to\nname its author and publisher. Until it has a name, MageOS_Seo publishes no Organization, and the\nBlogPosting names neither rather than reference one the page doesn't have.</li>\n<li><strong>MageOS_Blog's BlogPosting is left out meanwhile</strong> (<code>Plugin\\Blog\\PostDetailJsonLdPlugin</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Turn MageOS_Seo's structured data off</strong> (Stores → Configuration → MageOS SEO → SEO →\nStructured Data (JSON-LD) → Enable JSON-LD Output) and MageOS_Blog's BlogPosting comes back, so\na post is never without one.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The article data is what MageOS_Blog resolves for the post's Open Graph tags, so the structured\ndata and the sharing tags agree:</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>BlogPosting</th>\n<th>From the post</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>headline</code></td>\n<td>Its Open Graph title, else its meta title, else its title</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>url</code>, <code>@id</code></td>\n<td>Its canonical URL (<code>{url}#article</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>datePublished</code></td>\n<td>Its publish date</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dateModified</code></td>\n<td>Its last update, when it has one</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>description</code></td>\n<td>Its Open Graph description, else its meta description, else its short content</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>image</code></td>\n<td>Its Open Graph image, else its featured image</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>keywords</code></td>\n<td>Its meta keywords, split at commas</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Open Graph and Twitter tags stay MageOS_Blog's: MageOS_Seo adds only <code>og:site_name</code> and\n<code>og:locale</code> on a post page, which MageOS_Blog does not write.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Requirements</h2><a id=\"user-content-requirements\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Requirements\" href=\"#requirements\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>PHP 8.3 – 8.5</li>\n<li>Magento Open Source / Mage-OS <strong>2.4.7 or newer</strong> (<code>magento/framework ^103.0.7</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>MageOS_Blog</strong> (<code>mage-os/module-blog</code> <code>^1.3</code>) and <strong>MageOS_Seo</strong> (<code>mage-os/module-seo</code> <code>^2.0</code>).\nNeither requires the other; install this module to connect them.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"composer require mage-os/module-blog-seo\nbin/magento module:enable MageOS_BlogSeo\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento cache:flush\"><pre>composer require mage-os/module-blog-seo\nbin/magento module:enable MageOS_BlogSeo\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento cache:flush</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There are no settings.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">How it hooks in</h2><a id=\"user-content-how-it-hooks-in\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: How it hooks in\" href=\"#how-it-hooks-in\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Where</th>\n<th>What</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etc/di.xml</code></td>\n<td><code>Model\\ArticleDataProvider</code> in <code>MageOS\\Seo\\Model\\StructuredData\\Provider\\ArticleSchemaProvider</code>'s <code>dataProviders</code>, for the <code>blog_post_view</code> handle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>etc/frontend/di.xml</code></td>\n<td><code>Plugin\\Blog\\PostDetailJsonLdPlugin</code>, an after plugin on <code>MageOS\\Blog\\ViewModel\\Post\\Detail::getJsonLd()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To describe posts differently, replace <code>Model\\ArticleDataProvider</code> with a preference.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"LICENSE\">OSL-3.0</a></p>\n</article></div>"
